    "himmel-look-point-transitions-source-v3.png: the top-row cells at zero-based columns 0, 1, and 2 are used for look-0/1/2; top-row column 3 is unused; all four bottom-row cells are used for point-0..3.",
    "himmel-read-rest-transitions-source-downlook-candidate.png: only the bottom-row cell at zero-based column 1 (the second cell) is used for final Himmel look-3; the other seven cells are unused.",
    "The art archive is a provenance set; runtime PNGs and SHA-256 values are listed in verification/runtime-resource-allowlist.json.",
    "The older Frieren sit/stretch source sheet contributes sit-0..3 only; its stretch cells are not used.",
    "Frieren F13 stretch-0..3 come from frieren-stretch-source-v2.png cells 0..3 and use one common registration; the older Frieren sit/stretch source sheet contributes sit-0..3 only.",
    "The public art archive contains 15 source sheets and 13 original prompt files. Two source sheets have no separately preserved prompt; this is recorded as missing in the source table."
